  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.82 Stratford Bog Pond. No person shall operate any boat powered by gasoline, naptha or any other petroleum products on Stratford Bog Pond in the town of Stratford.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; amd by #4826, eff 6-1-90; amd by #5177, eff 7-19-91; amd by #5256, eff 10-22-91; amd by #5862, eff 7-1-94; amd by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES: 5-3-95 (formerly Saf-C 402.72); ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95; amd by #6490, eff 4-22-97; amd by #6770, EMERGENCY, eff 6-18-98, EXPIRES: 10-16-98; amd by #6790, REPEAL OF EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-2-98; amd by #6791, EMERGENCY, eff 7-2-98, EXPIRES: 10-30-98; amd by #6793, REPEAL OF EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-6-98; amd by #6794, EMERGENCY, eff 7-6-98, EXPIRES: 11-3-98; amd by #6798, REPEAL OF EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-10-98; amd by #6799, EMERGENCY, eff 7-10-98, EXPIRES: 11-7-98; amd by #6800, REPEAL OF EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-14-98; amd by #6815, eff 7-24-98; amd by #7021, eff 6-24-99; amd by #7286, eff 5-23-00; amd by #7534, eff 7-25-01; paragraphs (b)-(ap) EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04, except for paragraphs (a) and (aq)-(au); ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.67); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.75) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
